      "type": "textEditor",
      "data": {
        "value": "<table class=\"cke_show_border\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99%; height: 179.2px;\" border=\"1\" data-cke-table-faked-selection-table=\"\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.4px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\"><strong>CLINICAL INDICATION:</strong></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">Case of Infilterating duct carcinoma</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.4px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\"><strong>INVESTIGATION:</strong></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">Her-2 neu amplification by FISH</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.4px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\"><strong>METHOD :</strong></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">Fluorescence in situ Hybridization (FISH)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.4px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\"><strong>SPECIMEN :</strong></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">Formalin fixed paraffin embedded tissue block</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.4px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\"><strong>PROBES USED :</strong></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">ZytoLight SPEC ERBB2/CEN 17 Dual Color Probe Kit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.4px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\"><strong>Block No.</strong></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">8407A/24</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.4px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\"><strong>TUMOUR PERCENTAGE</strong>:</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">15%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.4px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\"><strong>ANALYSIS METHOD:</strong></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">MANUAL</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>RESULTS: </strong>Inconclusive results for Her2 Neu by FISH was observed on the block received for testing. The test has been performed twice along with the control. No signals were observed in the tumour tissue of the block received, however control block showed signals for both ERBB2 gene and CEP17. This can be due to overfixation or type of fixative used. Advice NGS for Her2 Neu status. Kindly correlate clinically.&nbsp;</p>",
        "field": "textEditor"
